 intro:'Help a third-year English student turn real experience into a credible CV for a local internship.',
 roleA:'You are Nusrat. You want a Programme Assistant internship in Rajshahi. You worry that your experience looks too small. Ask your partner which experiences match the job. Do not invent qualifications.',
 roleB:'You are the careers adviser. The fictional advert asks for event registration, student communication, and simple documents. It requests a one-page English CV. AI editing is permitted; every claim must be true. Ask Nusrat what she actually did.',
 goal:'A one-page CV that is relevant, accurate, readable, and easy to explain in an interview.',
