 ['Who should draft clearer bullet points?',['AI drafts from facts; Nusrat checks the meaning.','Nusrat must never accept AI wording.','AI writes and submits the CV independently.'],0,'Drafting can be delegated while the student keeps control of meaning and final use.'],
 ['What should happen to private contact details?',['Upload her national ID for authenticity.','Ask AI to find her details online.','Use placeholders; add verified details in the final document.'],2,'The drafting task needs experience, not an identity document or private contact details.']
