 brief:{product:'A one-page English CV for the Programme Assistant internship, using plain language and relevant evidence.',process:'First ask about missing dates or facts. Then draft from the evidence. Mark gaps instead of guessing.',performance:'Be a supportive, honest careers editor. Challenge exaggeration and explain wording I cannot easily say.'},
 prompt:'Help me draft a one-page English CV for a Programme Assistant internship in Rajshahi. The role involves registration, student communication, and simple documents. Use only my fact sheet. Ask about missing facts before drafting; never invent skills, grades, or numbers. Use clear English I can explain in an interview. Act as a supportive but honest editor and flag exaggeration. Use [email] and [phone].',
 clarification:'Before drafting: when do you expect to graduate, and do you have a measured result from your tutoring?',
