 exit:['The AI changes “helped at one event” to “managed a programme.” What is the best next action?',['Keep it because it sounds professional.','Ask for a precise rewrite that preserves the actual role.','Replace the student’s evidence with the AI version.'],1,'Preserve meaning when improving style. The person must be able to stand behind the sentence.'],
